        <title type="html"><![CDATA[build(deps-dev): bump svgo from 4.0.1 to 4.0.2]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44898</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44898"/>
        <updated>2026-07-23T23:33:46.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Bumps <a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo">svgo</a> from 4.0.1 to 4.0.2.</p>
<details>
<summary>Release notes</summary>
<p dir="auto"><em>Sourced from <a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/releases">svgo's releases</a>.</em></p>
<blockquote>
<h2 dir="auto">v4.0.2</h2>
<h2 dir="auto">What's Changed</h2>
<h3 dir="auto">Security</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://svgo.dev/docs/plugins/removeScripts/" rel="nofollow">removeScripts</a>, remove JavaScript URIs case-insensitively and make <code class="notranslate">&lt;script&gt;</code> handling namespace aware. By <a href="https://github.com/SethFalco"><code class="notranslate">@​SethFalco</code></a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://svgo.dev/docs/plugins/convertColors/" rel="nofollow">convertColors</a>, skip case-normalization for CSS custom properties. By <a href="https://github.com/SethFalco"><code class="notranslate">@​SethFalco</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/pull/2213">svg/svgo#2213</a></li>
<li><a href="https://svgo.dev/docs/plugins/convertPathData/" rel="nofollow">convertPathData</a>, improve handling of consecutive <code class="notranslate">t</code> commands. By <a href="https://github.com/KTibow"><code class="notranslate">@​KTibow</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/pull/2156">svg/svgo#2156</a></li>
<li><a href="https://svgo.dev/docs/plugins/convertPathData/" rel="nofollow">convertPathData</a>, safer handling of paths. By <a href="https://github.com/KTibow"><code class="notranslate">@​KTibow</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2158">svg/svgo#2158</a></li>
<li>Improve parsing of negative (or +) arc radii. By <a href="https://github.com/KTibow"><code class="notranslate">@​KTibow</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/pull/2205">svg/svgo#2205</a></li>
<li>When converting to a data URI, only encode it as a data URI once. By <a href="https://github.com/johnkenny54"><code class="notranslate">@​johnkenny54</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/pull/2053">svg/svgo#2053</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Performance</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://svgo.dev/docs/plugins/mergePaths/" rel="nofollow">mergePaths</a>, speed up child node removal. By <a href="https://github.com/mozzie"><code class="notranslate">@​mozzie</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/pull/2216">svg/svgo#2216</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Other Changes</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://svgo.dev/docs/plugins/removeAttributesBySelector/" rel="nofollow">removeAttributesBySelector</a>, log warning and noop if missing parameters. By <a href="https://github.com/KTibow"><code class="notranslate">@​KTibow</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/pull/2215">svg/svgo#2215</a></li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Commits</summary>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/b2309cf541aee11634eb653157b0ff86ab326e98"><code class="notranslate">b2309cf</code></a> chore: sync version with api</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/f529cfccc6c154d6f6eabe276ec637a8c5db6763"><code class="notranslate">f529cfc</code></a> Merge commit from fork</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/581fe687825740e425012bbdf6491ee4bbc9dc65"><code class="notranslate">581fe68</code></a> performance: speed up mergePath child node removal (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2216">#2216</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/eb4c8b69d4b589addaf98e56cd17241d4a39ad77"><code class="notranslate">eb4c8b6</code></a> docs(removeAttributesBySelector): properly document and check types (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2215">#2215</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/6fd58725fc934ab51bc4ed84e7299dc73d72442b"><code class="notranslate">6fd5872</code></a> fix(convertColors): skip convertCase on css custom properties (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2213">#2213</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/7414f739a44b126750b119d5e22a88db3d4bd9c6"><code class="notranslate">7414f73</code></a> fix: properly parse negative (or +) arc radii (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2205">#2205</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/a8c19aadc55935e5ce7e3c5ad0a8915fda758f5e"><code class="notranslate">a8c19aa</code></a> fix: only call encodeSVGDatauri once and add test case (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2053">#2053</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/65548f48e30bf123475ae4ca7ab21220703cb42a"><code class="notranslate">65548f4</code></a> fix(convertPathData): properly handle consecutive t commands (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2156">#2156</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/a41a7c15b2243b944c5087e56575baa2e6e9fcc1"><code class="notranslate">a41a7c1</code></a> fix(convertPathData): introducing isSafeToRemove (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2164">#2164</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/commit/38625dd1bd426289f9985ee366132e620f932dcc"><code class="notranslate">38625dd</code></a> test: handle charm icons (<a href="https://redirect.github.com/svg/svgo/issues/2203">#2203</a>)</li>
<li>See full diff in <a href="https://github.com/svg/svgo/compare/v4.0.1...v4.0.2">compare view</a></li>
</ul>
</details>
<br>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent." alt="Dependabot compatibility score" data-canonical-src="https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=svgo&amp;package-manager=npm_and_yarn&amp;previous-version=4.0.1&amp;new-version=4.0.2" style="max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
